OL,3,GNEWSAClosures to remain on road to
OL,4,AChristmas market
OL,5,
OL,6,FReports of "daily chaos" on a road that
OL,7,Fleads to the UK's largest Christmas
OL,8,Fmarket are likely to continue after a
OL,9,Fpetition to open an alternative route
OL,10,Fwas unsuccessful.
OL,12,FThe A36 Beckford Road, in Bath, was
OL,13,Fdamaged by contractors who were
OL,14,Fwidening the pavement when they broke
OL,15,Fthrough the roof of a 200-year-old
OL,16,Fcanal tunnel that lies beneath it.
OL,18,FIt reduced the popular route to Bath
OL,19,FChristmas Market to a single lane with
OL,20,Ftemporary traffic lights where it
OL,21,Fpasses over the Kennet & Avon Canal.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
