OL,3,GNEWSAClosures to remain on road to
OL,4,AChristmas market
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents had called on Bath and North
OL,7,FEast Somerset Council to reopen Sydney
OL,8,FRoad as an alternative route, but the
OL,9,Fcouncil said that was unnecessary and
OL,10,Fwould "continue to monitor the
OL,11,Fsituation".
